#: ../../source/docs/evaluating-the-aircraft-tune.rst:5
#: 50a6b8638f184d44a05cacb138346c4e
msgid "Evaluating the aircraft tune"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/evaluating-the-aircraft-tune.rst:8
#: 4d1444a7db9f4a74a92c95336319f93d
msgid "Most pilots will look to move to Autotune as quickly as possible once their aircraft can hover safely in AltHold. Before Autotune is run the pilot should ensure that the current tune is good enough to recover from the repeated tests run by Autotune. To test the current state of tune:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/evaluating-the-aircraft-tune.rst:10
#: ../../source/docs/evaluating-the-aircraft-tune.rst:19
#: 5264602c2e944933843d5355d22558bb
#: 07e156a5111a43d8988cd1ab8a481f5d
msgid "Take off in AltHold or STABILIZE"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/evaluating-the-aircraft-tune.rst:11
#: 2fe3b68d759a466ca5b266c7cf4cf2e7
msgid "Apply small roll and pitch inputs. Start with 5 degree inputs and releasing the stick to centre, pitch, left, right, roll forward back, then all 4 points on the diagonal"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/evaluating-the-aircraft-tune.rst:12
#: b35261fd8e944ff989542266af52dd0c
msgid "Increase inputs gradually to full stick deflection"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/evaluating-the-aircraft-tune.rst:13
#: 6e881b6fded7480faa1552c3b0086630
msgid "Go to full stick deflection and letting the sticks spring back to centre"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/evaluating-the-aircraft-tune.rst:15
#: 3ded4502f27c4ef78731757a8d751d97
msgid "If the aircraft begins to overshoot significantly or oscillate after the stick input, halt the tests before the situation begins to endanger the aircraft. The aircraft may require manual tuning (:ref:`see next section <ac_rollpitchtuning>`) before autotune can be run."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/evaluating-the-aircraft-tune.rst:17
#: ae3a4ee50852447ea040aa79a35f6d3f
msgid "To test the stabilization loops independent of the input shaping, set the parameter: :ref:`ATC_RATE_FF_ENAB <ATC_RATE_FF_ENAB>` to 0."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/evaluating-the-aircraft-tune.rst:20
#: 8da47fe0797d411b99e263a36675ace3
msgid "Hold a roll or pitch input"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/evaluating-the-aircraft-tune.rst:21
#: 83a4fb5ce74847d3bcba674ffab0cc8f
msgid "Release the stick and observe the overshoot as the aircraft levels itself"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/evaluating-the-aircraft-tune.rst:22
#: 476e7d5921e445ed9c788fa977698245
msgid "Gradually increase the stick deflection to 100%"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/evaluating-the-aircraft-tune.rst:24
#: 2e558410cd964acbb9268969e7b1d962
msgid "Halt the tests if the aircraft overshoots level significantly or if the aircraft oscillates, the aircraft may require manual tuning (:ref:`see next section <ac_rollpitchtuning>`) before autotune can be run."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/evaluating-the-aircraft-tune.rst:26
#: 3babce14cb7544c5a8edcde897cf1c59
msgid "Set :ref:`ATC_RATE_FF_ENAB <ATC_RATE_FF_ENAB>` to 1 after the tests are complete."
msgstr ""
